  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards Universal Access to Potable Water</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aspiring to realise improved health and wellbeing, gender equality and rights and women empowerment evidenced by reduced diarrhoeal diseases outbreaks including cholera and more participation domination in decision making positions of user communities of water supply facilities. Objective: The overall objective of this project is to increase the proportion of community members accessing safe drinking water in schools, health care facilities and their community in Machinga and Zomba districts</narrative>
  </description>
